  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">학기말 과학시간에 학생들이 자신의 관심과 진로와 관련된 콘텐츠를 찾아보는 활동은 어떠신가요?&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">과탐실 시간에 진행하는 활동입니다.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">활동 내용을 세특에 써줄 예정입니다.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. SOAK(<u><a href=\"https://soak.so/ko/main\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://soak.so/ko/main</a></u>)에 접속한다. 간편 로그인한다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 아래의 CATEGORY에서 관심 분야와 콘텐츠를 찾아 시청한다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3. 퀴즈와 저자 질문을 작성하고, 아래 활동지를 작성한다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e2d037e965d1e6ab6a2ea8e3d77f6440161566c0?download\" data-file-name=\"과탐실(soak) 활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"3781632\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D463%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20260707104325&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fe2d037e965d1e6ab6a2ea8e3d77f6440161566c0')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">과탐실(soak) 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.61MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f03934965e81f42ef81f49f9b138b5993e596ca2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f03934965e81f42ef81f49f9b138b5993e596ca2\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"476\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8f0e356eb4a59e8dc97b40a6c93560689b327d5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8f0e356e